ooldown":[10.0,8.0],"ailment":"重伤"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":null,"Height":[165],"Weight":[51]},"tribes":["元素精灵"],"story":"卡洛儿，执行圣诞节守护任务的光元素精灵。\n\n对圣诞节虎视眈眈的恶魔每年都会穿越次元来到人间，为了阻止意外的发生，光元素精灵派出元素精灵部队与之战斗，而卡洛儿正是这支部队的指挥官。卡洛儿一直以来的愿望都是圆满完成任务并让人们度过幸福的圣诞节，而愿望的实现也会让她获得快乐。圣诞节结束后，卡洛儿和队员们会立刻备战下一个圣诞节，刻苦训练没有一丝怠慢。据说，卡洛儿的部队以训练量巨大出名，但士兵们不但没有怨言，而且坚决服从卡洛儿的指挥，甚至部队里还有她的粉丝后援会。可见一贯活泼开朗的卡洛儿人气有多高。\n\n擅长华丽的剑术，也是卡洛儿受欢迎的原因。曾经和她一起训练过的士兵提到：看卡洛儿与敌人战斗，像是在看现场演出。她挥舞武器宛若轻盈的舞姿，与敌人演绎了一场精彩的表演。\n\n看似完美的卡洛儿只有一个缺点——糟糕的时尚感。她曾经穿便服离开部队，没想到那次搭配被《元素精灵杂志》评选为“年度最差着装”。自那天起，受到刺激的卡洛儿为了增加时尚感，开始认真学习时尚知识，并向他人请教着装搭配。有时，卡洛儿也会穿着士兵推荐的服装上阵指挥，每当她这么做时，士兵们的战斗士气就会大幅提升。由于士兵们的反响热烈，卡洛儿信心倍增，对时尚的热情也与日俱增。每当休假时，卡洛儿会偷偷去到人间，探索人类服饰的奥秘。最近，梅丽尔的不正经的穿搭让卡洛儿感触颇深。","storyKey":"profile_captain_rabbit_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=440","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=440","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"],"voiceAudio":"gtaudio/data/offline-package.json; CharacterVoiceType; heroes.json VoiceId"},"voiceLines":[{"id":"captain_rabbit","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["欧耶～！又是一次轻松的胜利！"],"enUS":["Yahoo! Another merry victory!"],"jaJP":["やっほ～！またもや愉快に勝利だよ！"]},"keys":["cv_captain_rabbit_NormalBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/440/4400001@3892552198976213528"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/440/4400001"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/440/4400001@7374156387072060466"]},"audioName":"4400001"},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["就这点本事，还想当队长？"],"enUS":["With that kind of skill, you call yourself boss?"],"jaJP":["この程度の実力でボスなの？またまたー♪"]},"keys":["cv_captain_rabbit_BossBattleWin"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/440/4400002@-1056858699681284778"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/440/4400002"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/440/4400002@4386970977101318102"]},"audioName":"4400002"},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["糟糕！中计了…"],"enUS":["Ugh, I’ve been had…"],"jaJP":["うう、やられちゃった…"]},"keys":["cv_captain_rabbit_Die"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/440/4400003@7262253812388444792"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/440/4400003"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/440/4400003@4660015713408431930"]},"audioName":"4400003"},{"type":"GetExp","label":"获得经验结晶","texts":{"zhCN":["嗯，还不错？"],"enUS":["Not bad, huh?"],"jaJP":["いいわね"]},"keys":["cv_captain_rabbit_GetExp"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/440/4400004@-2334164145645205803"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/440/4400004"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/440/4400004@-6299716006409112864"]},"audioName":"4400004"},{"type":"LevelUp","label":"升级","texts":{"zhCN":["感觉自己变得更强啦～！"],"enUS":["I’ve gotten stronger, I can feel it!"],"jaJP":["一層強くなったのを感じるよ～！"]},"keys":["cv_captain_rabbit_LevelUp"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/440/4400005@-2164946042623634354"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/440/4400005"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/440/4400005@-2946172575423071030"]},"audioName":"4400005"},{"type":"EquipWeapon","label":"佩戴装备","texts":{"zhCN":["这、这是送给我的礼物吗？太感谢啦！"],"enUS":["I-Is that a gift for me? Thank you so much!"],"jaJP":["えっ、私へのプレゼント？本当にありがとう！"]},"keys":["cv_captain_rabbit_EquipWeapon"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/440/4400006@7458896326606081190"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/440/4400006"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/440/4400006@6413440178269116735"]},"audioName":"4400006"},{"type":"EquipCostume","label":"穿戴时装","texts":{"zhCN":["对我来说，这套时装简直太完美了！"],"enUS":["To me, this outfit is perfect!"],"jaJP":["私にとって、最高のファッションだよ！"]},"keys":["cv_captain_rabbit_EquipCostume"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/440/4400007@1732526143001862494"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/440/4400007"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/440/4400007@-6689222137118976818"]},"audioName":"4400007"},{"type":"Evolve","label":"进化","texts":{"zhCN":["今年圣诞节也由我来守护！"],"enUS":["I’ll protect you this Christmas too!"],"jaJP":["今度のクリスマスも、私が守ってあげるねっ！"]},"keys":["cv_captain_rabbit_Evolve"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/440/4400008@7290487932054450259"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/440/4400008"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/440/4400008@5187302025203986208"]},"audioName":"4400008"},{"type":"Attack1","label":"攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["咿呀～！"],"enUS":["I-yap!"],"jaJP":["やっ！"]},"keys":["cv_captain_rabbit_Attack1"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/440/4400009@7562798973977901157"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/440/4400009"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/440/4400009@-3275737188718208445"]},"audioName":"4400009"},{"type":"Attack2","label":"攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["嗬呀！"],"enUS":["Ha-at!"],"jaJP":["はあっ！"]},"keys":["cv_captain_rabbit_Attack2"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/440/4400010@-7831396066423797367"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/440/4400010"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/440/4400010@2300412593644078117"]},"audioName":"4400010"},{"type":"Attack3","label":"攻击3","texts":{"zhCN":["别想了～！"],"enUS":["It’s futile!"],"jaJP":["無駄よ～！"]},"keys":["cv_captain_rabbit_Attack3"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/440/4400011@-2154121429265298587"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/440/4400011"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/440/4400011@4992624406393725050"]},"audioName":"4400011"},